    <string name="summary_empty">No missed calls today</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Teléfono has no ads or analytics. It reads the phone\'s call log and contacts only to show them here; it keeps no copies. Of the SIMs it only reads which can call and which one each call used. The WhatsApp button only opens WhatsApp with the number; Teléfono doesn\'t go online for it. Inicio only sees today\'s missed calls. Only if you turn on MCP mode, the AI you connect with a token can see your calls and, with a read-and-write token, ask you to call someone with a notification: you decide whether to call. The AI never dials, answers or hangs up. If you make Teléfono your call filter, it decides on the phone, with your rules and your blocked list, whether each call rings, is silenced or declined; the voice announcement uses the phone\'s own voice. None of it leaves the phone. Teléfono doesn\'t record calls.</string>
