    <string name="role_title">Teléfono as call filter</string>
    <string name="role_text">Android asks the app that holds the «call screening» role what to do with every incoming call: let it ring, silence it or decline it. Teléfono only decides with your rules below, on the phone and without internet. It never answers, hangs up or records. You can take the role away any time in Android settings (Default apps).</string>
